{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3094","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3094","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3094\",\"parent_revision\":\"e85336299e442302b812811ce9854a2ce66893e2\",\"root_revision\":\"3beb11fb191356408938920f5d50685cf812340169db8beb57bae9f3ac49d625\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P2\\ntype: Chore\\nstatus: needs-grooming\\nadded: 2026-08-20\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\ndevelopment-harness plugin agents (`agents/*.md` frontmatter `tools:` lists) may need `Bash` access to run this plugin's CLI equivalent (`uv run sam_schema/cli.py ...`), but repo-level `.claude/settings.json` permission grants (e.g. `Bash(uv run:*)`) only affect local development of this repo \u2014 they do NOT ship with the plugin and have zero effect for anyone who installs `development-harness` via the marketplace. The only mechanism that reaches actual plugin users is each agent's own `tools:` frontmatter declaration in `agents/*.md` \u2014 an agent without `Bash` in its `tools:` list cannot invoke the CLI at all, regardless of any permission setting, on any machine.\\n\\nDiscovered during #3062's grooming: some swarm-role agents used during grooming (`dh:impact-analyst`, `dh:backlog-item-groomer`) do not declare `Bash` and genuinely don't need it for their current jobs (Read/Grep-based inventory building and MCP-sourced content synthesis), while others that would plausibly need to invoke CLI-equivalent commands do declare it (`dh:fact-checker`, `dh:technical-researcher`, `dh:classifier`, `dh:alignment-analyst`, `dh:rtica-assessor`) \u2014 so there is no immediately-blocking gap found so far, but this has not been systematically audited across the full agent roster.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **maintainer of the project infrastructure**, I want to **chore: audit development-harness agents for missing bash access to cli equivalents** so that **the project infrastructure stays healthy**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Agent task - auto-derived from input\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-20\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"e622693a27f688c3e6817c526a99657321a9f9c9941e0148b4c1267bb7fb28ed\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABYnRxdQ\",\"fields\":{\"followup_to\":\"\",\"close_reference\":\"\",\"added\":\"2026-08-20\",\"layer\":\"\",\"research_first\":\"\",\"source\":\"Not specified\",\"priority\":\"P2\",\"language\":\"\",\"suggested_location\":\"\",\"status\":\"needs-grooming\",\"close_reason\":\"\",\"stack\":\"\",\"item_type\":\"Chore\",\"close_comment\":\"\",\"files\":\"\",\"topic\":\"\",\"groomed\":\"\",\"plan\":\"\"}}"}